winecoreaudio.drv: Play through RemoteIO on iOS.

An AVAudioSession is set up first (coreaudio_ios.m), endpoints are
RemoteIO, the render period is 25 ms and the timer loop waits at most
10 ms. MIDI is stubbed out. avrt runs audio threads at TIME_CRITICAL.
